{"version":1,"content":"<p>「雙十一」（11月11日）購物節將近，中國郵政廣州郵區中心江高郵件處理中心開始繁忙。</p><p>中心的工作人員、機械人和各類自動化分揀設備昨日（11月1日）已加緊作業，處理快遞包裹，保障物流正常運轉。</p><p>（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:41:20.697411+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:48:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.659936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:38:07.689506+00:00","content_hash":"789efefcaae91ab94caff47651fb305c5985a49d6987e404e7af07995a3ce037","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}